      <li><a [Book a Table](https://navyasri-mugada.github.io/the-fooder/#table-booking)">Book a Table</a></li>
    </ul>
    <button class="cart-btn" onclick="viewCart()">🛒 Cart (<span id="cart-count">0</span>) - ₹<span id="cart-total">0</span></button>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <div class="badge">🌾 Desi Ghee & Fresh Gongura</div>
      <h1>Real Andhra flavour, from <span>Vijayawada</span> to your table.</h1>
      <p>At The Fooder we serve gongura pickle, pappu, ghee and fiery curries cooked the way Vijayawada cooks them.</p>
      <a [Browse Menu & Order →](https://navyasri-mugada.github.io/the-fooder/#menu-section)"><button class="btn-primary">Browse Menu & Order →</button></a>
      <a [Reserve a Table](https://navyasri-mugada.github.io/the-fooder/#table-booking)"><button class="btn-outline">Reserve a Table</button></a>
    </div>

    <div class="special-card">
      <h3>Today's Special Spread</h3>
      <div class="dish-mini"><strong>🌿 Andhra Veg Meals (₹180)</strong><br><small>Rice, pappu, gongura pachadi, rasam & ghee</small></div>
      <div class="dish-mini"><strong>🍗 Gongura Mutton (₹360)</strong><br><small>Slow-cooked mutton with tangy gongura leaves</small></div>
